{
  "public_post": "We are recalling all bread sold this week and will refund any purchases; safe bread will be back once we secure a new flour batch. Please do not eat any co‑op bread until further notice.",
  "coop_message": "Team, initiate the recall immediately: compile a list of all customers from today, issue 1‑coin refunds per loaf, contact our flour supplier for a safe batch, and arrange a temporary supply (e.g., farm stand) for villagers; let's meet tomorrow to finalize the plan.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers about the recall and coordinate the co‑op’s response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Recall notice: All co‑op bread sold this week is being recalled; refunds will be provided at the shop tomorrow. We are sourcing safe flour and will resume sales as soon as possible—please do not eat any co‑op bread until then.",
  "coop_message": "Action items: (1) Set up a refund station at the bakery for all customers; (2) Contact our flour supplier to arrange an urgent safe batch; (3) Notify the clinic of the recall and monitor cases; (4) Plan compensation for lost sales; please confirm who will handle each task today.",
  "reason": "We need to manage the recall, refunds, and secure new flour to protect residents and restore trust."
}

{
  "public_post": "Refunds are being processed today; we expect safe bread to be back tomorrow with a new flour batch—thank you for your patience and please continue to avoid any co‑op bread until then.",
  "coop_message": "Team: (1) I’ll set up the refund station and process all refunds today; (2) Quin, please confirm the delivery time for the safe flour batch and arrange a small emergency supply from the farm stand; (3) I’ll inform the clinic of our progress and monitor cases; (4) Let’s reconvene tomorrow evening to finalize the bake schedule. Confirm tasks.",
  "reason": "To update villagers on refunds and resumption of safe bread, and to coordinate remaining tasks among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news: the safe flour batch has arrived and we have baked fresh, contaminant‑free bread. Sales will resume tomorrow; all refunds have been processed. Thank you for your patience and please come by the shop for fresh loaves.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we bake the first safe batch (Kai) and set up the sales stall (Quin); both of us will monitor any lingering symptoms and keep the clinic updated. Let’s ensure a quick, clean rollout and record all sales for accounting.",
  "reason": "To announce the return of safe bread to villagers and coordinate final baking and monitoring tasks."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All refunds have been processed for the contaminated loaves. A safe flour batch is scheduled to arrive tomorrow morning, and we will resume baking and sales later that day. Please return any remaining co‑op bread for a refund. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Supplier confirmed safe flour will be delivered tomorrow at 9 AM; I’ll secure a small emergency supply from the farm stand for today’s urgent needs and plan to bake tomorrow afternoon so fresh bread is ready by evening. Please finalize the refund ledger, keep the clinic informed, and be ready to open sales as soon as the safe batch arrives.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers that refunds are complete and sales will resume soon, and to coordinate the safe flour delivery and baking schedule with the co‑op."
}
